# Repository naming

- Domain contract: `SomethingRepository` (interface), usually under `domain/`
- Data implementation: `SomethingRepositoryImpl`, usually under `data/`
- Koin binds `SomethingRepositoryImpl` to `SomethingRepository`

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD
interface FeatureFlags
class FeatureFlagsRepository : FeatureFlags
class DefaultFeatureFlags : FeatureFlags

// ✅ GOOD
interface FeatureFlagsRepository
class FeatureFlagsRepositoryImpl : FeatureFlagsRepository
```

Do not use `Default*` as the production repository implementation name.
